ーフ","f":"du bœuf","r":"gyūniku"},{"t":"魚","f":"du poisson","r":"sakana"},{"t":"ハム","f":"du jambon","r":"hamu"},{"t":"ソーセージ","f":"de la saucisse","r":"sōsēji"},{"t":"チーズ","f":"du fromage","r":"chīzu"},{"t":"卵 / 玉子","f":"des œufs","r":"tamago"},{"t":"サラダ","f":"de la salade","r":"sarada"},{"t":"(新鮮な)野菜","f":"des légumes","r":"(shinsen-na) yasai"},{"t":"(新鮮な)果物","f":"des fruits","r":"(shinsen-na) kudamono"},{"t":"パン","f":"du pain","r":"pan"},{"t":"トースト","f":"du pain grillé","r":"tōsuto"},{"t":"麺類","f":"des nouilles","r":"menrui"},{"t":"豆","f":"des haricots","r":"mame"},{"t":"_____ を一本下さい。","f":"Puis-je avoir une bouteille de _____ ?","r":"_____ wo ippon kudasai."},{"t":"コーヒー","f":"le café","r":"kōhī"},{"t":"ジュース / 果汁","f":"du jus","r":"jūsu"},{"t":"ミルク / 牛乳 (gyūnyū)","f":"du lait","r":"miruku"},{"t":"水","f":"de l’eau","r":"mizu"},{"t":"ビール","f":"de la bière","r":"bīru"},{"t":"塩","f":"du sel","r":"shio"},{"t":"胡椒","f":"du poivre","r":"koshō"},{"t":"すみません。","f":"Excusez-moi, serveur ?","r":"sumimasen"},{"t":"ご馳走さまでした。","f":"C’était délicieux.","r":"Gochisōsama deshita."},{"t":"お皿を下げてください。","f":"Vous pouvez débarrasser, s’il vous plaît.","r":"Osara o sagete kudasai."},{"t":"お勘定お願いします。 / 会計お願いします。","f":"L’addition, s’il vous plaît.","r":"O-kanjo onegaishimasu."},{"t":"\"Thank you very much!\", said when a customer leaves.","f":"Arigatō gozaimashita!","r":"","en":1},{"t":"お腹がすきました。","f":"I'm hungry.","r":"Onaka ga sukimashita.","en":1},{"t":"一人・二人です。","f":"A table for one person/two people, please.","r":"Hitori/futari desu.","en":1},{"t":"メニューを下さい。","f":"Please bring a menu.","r":"Menu wo kudasai.","en":1},{"t":"お任せします。","f":"Please choose for me.","r":"O-makase shimasu.","en":1},{"t":"生の魚はだめです。","f":"I don't eat raw fish.","r":"Nama no sakana wa dame desu.","en":1},{"t":"油を控えて下さい。","f":"Please do not use too much oil.","r":"Abura wo hikaete kudasai.","en":1},{"t":"一品料理","f":"à la carte","r":"ippinryōri","en":1},{"t":"軽食 / おやつ","f":"light meal/snack","r":"keishoku","en":1},{