ūsu"},{"t":"もう一つください。","f":"Un autre, s’il vous plaît.","r":"Mō hitotsu kudasai."},{"t":"みんなに同じものを一杯ずつください。","f":"La même chose, s’il vous plaît.","r":"Minna ni onaji mono o ippai zutsu kudasai."},{"t":"閉店は何時ですか?","f":"À quelle heure fermez-vous ?","r":"Heiten wa nanji desuka?"},{"t":"熱燗 Heated sake. Recommended only in winter with cheap sake.","f":"atsukan","r":"","en":1},{"t":"冷や Sake at room temperature.","f":"hiya","r":"","en":1},{"t":"冷酒 Chilled sake. The way to drink better sake.","f":"reishu","r":"","en":1},{"t":"ちょこ A tiny gulp-sized ceramic cup for sake.","f":"choko","r":"","en":1},{"t":"徳利 A small ceramic jug used to pour sake, contains around one or two gō/gōs","f":"tokkuri","r":"","en":1},{"t":"一合 The standard measure for servings of sake, around 180 milliliters.","f":"ichigō","r":"","en":1},{"t":"一升瓶 The standard sake bottle, containing 10 gō, ie. 1.8 liters.","f":"isshōbin","r":"","en":1},{"t":"ビール一杯・二杯下さい。","f":"A beer/two beers, please.","r":"Biiru ippai/nihai kudasai.","en":1},{"t":"赤・白ワイン一杯下さい。","f":"A glass of red/white wine, please.","r":"Aka/shiro wain ippai kudasai.","en":1},{"t":"(ビールの)ジョッキ下さい。","f":"A mug (of beer), please.","r":"(Bīru no) jokki kudasai.","en":1},{"t":"_____ と _____ 下さい。","f":"_____ (hard liquor) and _____ (mixer), please.","r":"_____ to _____ kudasai.","en":1},{"t":"日本酒","f":"sake","r":"nihonshu","en":1},{"t":"焼酎","f":"Japanese liquor","r":"shōchū","en":1},{"t":"ウイスキー","f":"whiskey","r":"uisukii","en":1},{"t":"ウォッカ","f":"vodka","r":"wokka","en":1},{"t":"ラム","f":"rum","r":"ramu","en":1},{"t":"ソーダ","f":"club soda","r":"sōda","en":1},{"t":"トニックウォーター","f":"tonic water","r":"tonikku wōtā","en":1},{"t":"コーラ","f":"cola (soda)","r":"kōra","en":1},{"t":"オンザロック","f":"with ice","r":"onzarokku (on the rocks)","en":1},{"t":"おつまみありますか?","f":"Do you have any bar snacks?","r":"O-tsumami arimasu ka?","en":1}],"quiz":[{"q":"Comment dit-on « Servez-vous de l’alcool ? » ?","choices":["テーブルサービスありますか?","お酒ありますか?","もう一つください。","冷や Sake at room temp